# ladder beat chart: one row per rung, designer data (GP40, Rogers ch4).
# Designers pace the climb here without a Rust edit; tools/beat-lint.mjs
# checks every row. Whole numbers only, `#` comments, no floats. Glory is
# counts (no suffix, like loop.rows); minutes are whole minutes per bout.
# Columns: tier (enemy tier 1..3 from enemies.rows; T4 primus stays PROPOSED
# per enemies.rows:18, so tier_3 holds the last rung), new_moves new_rules
# new_arena (new elements this rung: a move, a rule, an arena variant; the
# sum equals ladder.rs RUNG_NEW_ELEMENTS 2,1,2,1,2,1,2,1 and is at most 3),
# reward (glory for a won bout: 100 + 25 per rung held, the ladder.rs math,
# so this file is a second door to the same numbers),
# penalty (glory lost on a lost bout: flat 25, the slow negative leg, N25),
# minutes (expected bout minutes, equal to ladder.rs RUNG_MINUTES
# 2,2,3,3,4,4,5,6; a bout length, never a launch time - the first bout start
# bar is ladder.rs FIRST_BOUT_START_SECS 45 with cap
# FIRST_BOUT_START_LIMIT_SECS 60, checked by its Rust test),
# rank (glory rank after winning this rung from fresh under ladder.rs floors
# 0/300/900/1800/3600, the career ranks Tiro, Miles, Immunis, Optio and
# Centurio; loop bonus 500 lands on the last rung), boss (1 only
# on the last rung). Each rung row names the rank it reaches in a trailing
# comment (rank <n> <name>), so the chart and crates/game/src/ladder.rs
# cannot drift; the floors live in content/design/loop.rows.
# Beat map (`new` counts RUNG_NEW_ELEMENTS: 2 on even rungs, 1 on odd):
# rung_0 light + parry (Holder grunt), rung_1 heavy, rung_2 dodge answer +
# stamina (Flanker veteran), rung_3 riposte, rung_4 stamina pressure + wall
# band, rung_5 elite pressure, rung_6 gate mouth + ring, rung_7 final bout
# (boss flag; GA15 primus replaces the tier). The arena= cell names the placement the rung runs (base, ludus or siege): new_arena is 1 when the rung swaps that placement and 0 when it keeps it.
table ladder version 1
rung_0 tier=1 new_moves=1 new_rules=1 new_arena=0 arena=base reward=100 penalty=25 minutes=2 rank=0 boss=0 # rank 0 Tiro
rung_1 tier=1 new_moves=1 new_rules=0 new_arena=0 arena=base reward=125 penalty=25 minutes=2 rank=0 boss=0 # rank 0 Tiro
rung_2 tier=2 new_moves=1 new_rules=1 new_arena=0 arena=base reward=150 penalty=25 minutes=3 rank=1 boss=0 # rank 1 Miles
rung_3 tier=2 new_moves=1 new_rules=0 new_arena=0 arena=base reward=175 penalty=25 minutes=3 rank=1 boss=0 # rank 1 Miles
rung_4 tier=2 new_moves=0 new_rules=1 new_arena=1 arena=ludus reward=200 penalty=25 minutes=4 rank=1 boss=0 # rank 1 Miles
rung_5 tier=3 new_moves=1 new_rules=0 new_arena=0 arena=ludus reward=225 penalty=25 minutes=4 rank=2 boss=0 # rank 2 Immunis
rung_6 tier=3 new_moves=1 new_rules=0 new_arena=1 arena=siege reward=250 penalty=25 minutes=5 rank=2 boss=0 # rank 2 Immunis
rung_7 tier=3 new_moves=1 new_rules=0 new_arena=0 arena=siege reward=275 penalty=25 minutes=6 rank=3 boss=1 # rank 3 Optio
